hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"154","[AI-translation] Us se Allah ki panah mange, shaitane-rajeem se Allah ki panah ke iqrar se. [Shaitan ke waswase ke khilaf]"
"155","[AI-translation] Azan di jaae. [Naumaulud ke daayein kaan mein azan]"
"156","[AI-translation] Zikr padhe aur Quran ki tilawat kare. [Pareshani aur waswase par]"
